  "rules": [
    "Agree the fare before you get in. Every time, even for a route you did yesterday.",
    "Say whether you want colectivo (shared, per person) or private (the whole car) — the gap between them is where visitors overpay.",
    "Carry small bills. Drivers often can't break a 20."
